title: 'C-c m h p : skg-mark-homeSkgrepo-move-processed'
pid: 59c5a0b3-8eb0-4dd1-a9a4-581a6c273628
body: |2-
  Marks processed the home-skgrepo move of the node at point (or the
  move at point), then saves. With a prefix argument (C-u C-c m h p), it
  does the same to every descendant whose home skgrepo moved between the
  same two skgrepos.
